      <activity id="ee6fced2-b34f-558d-8e46-f9f9a0673554" activityNameId="d04f807f-80ba-53b7-b531-f391556c7c9a" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Diethyl ether, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Diethyl ether, at plant
The multioutput-process "ethylene hydration process" delivers the co-products ethanol 99.7% in H2O and diethyl ether 99.95% in H2O. The allocation is based on mass balance.;
UUID: 4bc7bf56-c0b6-3afc-838b-cf42873ba494
Direct hydration of ethylene including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled with data from plants in Europe and India.
Technology: Direct hydration of ethylene
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: Some data are derived from other or unknown plants or have been estimated.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_4bc7bf56-c0b6-3afc-838b-cf42873ba494.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
